			<table style="BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: gold; BORDER-TOP-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: gold; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: ridge; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: gold; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: ridge" height="100" cellspacing="0" cols="4" cellpadding="5" width="100%" align="left" border="5"><tbody><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">10 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Shadowblade </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">A deadly attack from behind while using stealth. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">11 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Reconnoiter </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases recon skills by 10 for better stealth and damage. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">12 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Bleed </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">A piercing attack that also deals damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">13 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Impale </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">High damage attack that also lowers a targets defense against piercing. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">13 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Hunter&#39;s Instinct </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases agility. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">14 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Stalk </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">This ability places you in stealth mode and lowers your threat level with the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">15 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Back Shot </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">An archery attack from behind. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">15 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Pierce </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Quick Attack that deals medium damage. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">16 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Open Shot </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Requires a ranged weapon. Launches two shots at once ignoring some enemy armor. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">17 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Blade Flurry </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Gives you a chance for an extra melee strike to target and another target on each successful strike. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">17 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Hunt </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Allows stealthed movement and the ability to see hidden enemies. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">18 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Survival Instincts </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increases parry and defense skills while lowering attack speed. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Pounce </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Attacks up to 5 creatures in the same encounter from stealth. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Predator</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Shrouded Strike </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">A flanking attack that deals medium damage and stealths the predator. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Greth&#39;s Willing Scout </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Summon&#39;s a rodent pet for the assassin. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Cut Throat </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">An extra attack from stealth that stifles a target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Slip away </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">An out of combat stealth. it also increases your movement rate. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Vex </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Lowers your targets AC. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">23 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Caltrops </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Decreases Enemy movement speed and deals low damage. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">24 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Ebon Blade </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Requires stealth and position behind an enemy. An attack that deals very high damage and reduces piercing resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">25 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Shadow </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increases agility and stalk skill. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">25 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Shadow </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases agility and stalk skill. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin/Brigand/Dirge<br />Ranger/Swashbuckler/Troubadour</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">25 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Escape </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Ports your group to zone in. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">26 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Agonizing Wound </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Precise extra attack that deals piercing damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">26 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Head Shot </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Launches a ranged attack that ignores the targets armor. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">27 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Insidious Cut </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">An extra attack that decreases enemy defense and slashing resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Hidden Assault </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">An area of effect attack. One must be in stealth to use it. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Shadow </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">This ability places you in stealth mode and lowers your threat level with a target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Shadow </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">This ability places you in stealth mode and lowers your thread level with a target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Shadow </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">This ability places you in stealth mode and lowers your threat level with a target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Shadow </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">This ability places you in stealth mode and lowers your thread level with a target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Cut </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">A quick attack that does medium damage and does slashing damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Cloaked Barb </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Requires position behind the enemy and a ranged weapon. A precise extra attack. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Deadly Shot </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Requires a ranged weapon. Launches two shots at once ignoring some enemy armors. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Makeshift weapon </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Use materials found in the assassins surroundings to create a fragile makeshift weapon that can only be used once. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">32 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Lethal Resolve </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Increase parry, defense and strength while reducing attack speed. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">32 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Numbing Strike </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Launches a melee attack that roots the target on a successful hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">33 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Spring </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Requires stealth. An attack that deals medium damage to all enemies in an encounter. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">33 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Spring </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Attacks up to 5 creatures in the same encounter from stealth. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">34 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Slice Throat </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">An extra attack it stifles the target on a successful hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">35 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Murderous Blade </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">A high damage stealth attack that decreases enemy poison and piercing resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">36 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Torment </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Decreases enemy defense, slashing and piercing resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">36 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Vanish </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">An out of combat stealth it alos increases your movement rate. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">37 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Moor </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Decreases enemy movement speed, deals damage and applies a minor damage shield to the assassin. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">38 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Bloodthirster </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Requires stealth and position behind and enemy. An attack that deals very high damage, reduces piercing resistance, and interupts the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">38 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Condemning Blade </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Launches an atack that does extreme damage. Assassins must be in stealth to perform this combat art. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">39 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Murderous Intent </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increase agility, stalk and assassin skills. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Troubadour </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">40 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Disguise: High Elf </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Disguises the troubadour as a high elf. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">40 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Disguise: High Elf </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Disguises the assassin as a high elf. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">40 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Assassin&#39;s shot </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Launches a ranged attack that ingores the target&#39;s armor. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">40 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Seeping Wound </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">A precise extra attack that deals piercing damage over time and reduces the strength of an enemy. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">40 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Murderous Focus </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases the damage and piercing skill of the assassin. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">41 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Merciless Villainy </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases agility, attack speed, and increases damage on a successful hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">41 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Ignore Wound </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">An extra attack that decreases enemy defense, slashing and poison resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Ranger</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">42 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Surveil </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">This ability places you in stealth mode and lowers your threat level with the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">42 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Surveil </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">This ability places you in stealth mode and lowers your threat level with the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">42 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Shadow Assault </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">An area of effect attack. One must be in stealth to use it. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">43 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Lingering Blow </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">A quick attack that deals instant medium damage then slashing and crushing damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">43 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Killer Instinct </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Requires a position behind the enemy and a ranged weapon. A precise extra attack that reduces enemy poison resistance. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">44 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Faltering Blast </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Requires a ranged weapon. Launches two shots at once, ignoring some enemy armor and interrupting spells. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">44 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Cripple </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Severely lowers the targets defense techniques on a successful hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">45 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Espionage </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Allows stealthed movement and the ability to see hidden enemies. If damage is taken the assassin is granted a burst of speed and increased agility. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">46 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Paralyzing Strike </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Launches a melee attack that roots the target on a successful hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">46 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Creeping Impetus </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Greatly increase parry, defense and strength while reducing attack speed. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">47 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Massacre </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Requires stealth. A precise attack that deals piercing damage over time to all enemies in an encounter. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">47 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Mask of Night </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">A flanking attack that deals medium damage, increases damage, slightly decreases defense, and stealths the assassin. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">48 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Garrote </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">An extra attack it stifles the target on a successful hit. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">49 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Punch Blade </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">A high damage stealth attack that decreases enemy poison resistance, piercing resistance, and defense. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">50 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Disappear </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">An out of combat stealth, it also increases your movement rate. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">50 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Assassinate </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Assassinate is a lethal ambush attack that can kill weaker enemies outright. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Assassin</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">50 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Anathema </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Decreases enemy defense, slashing, piercing and crushing resistance. </td></tr></tbody></table>
	
